  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Nylon Paracord Type III 550 LB is a pinnacle of strength and reliability, crafted in the United States. Tested to withstand 550 LB, this service-grade paracord features a durable 7-strand core and a 5/32 inches diameter, ensuring optimal tensile strength for various applications. Originally utilized by the service, this lightweight cord has become a go-to for camping, survival situations, and inclusion in Bug Out Bags. Its multi-functional utility extends to crafting bracelets, key-chains, and an array of rope accessories.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "43475",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's Nylon Paracord Type III 550 LB is a pinnacle of strength and reliability, crafted in the United States. Tested to withstand 550 LB, this service-grade paracord features a durable 7-strand core and a 5/32 inches diameter, ensuring optimal tensile strength for various applications. Originally utilized by the service, this lightweight cord has become a go-to for camping, survival situations, and inclusion in Bug Out Bags. Its multi-functional utility extends to crafting bracelets, key-chains, and an array of rope accessories, making it an essential tool in everyday life. Produced in the USA, this paracord is a testament to American craftsmanship.&nbsp; Rothco's Nylon Paracord stands as a symbol of strength, versatility, and durability&mdash;perfectly suited for both professional and recreational applications. Elevate your preparedness and crafting endeavors with a paracord that meets the rigorous standards set by the U.S. Government.</p>",
